      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-177157\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-177157\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>The ground snow load, <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">P<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">g<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t, shall be indicated. The following additional information shall also be provided, regardless of whether snow loads govern the design of the roof:<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-177158\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-177158\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;1.&#160;&#160;&#160;Flat-roof snow load, <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">P<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">f<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-177159\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-177159\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;2.&#160;&#160;&#160;Snow exposure factor, <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">C<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">e<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-177160\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-177160\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;3.&#160;&#160;&#160;Snow load impo