he sum of <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">P<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">d<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t and <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">P<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">f<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t exceeds 20 psf (0.96 kN\/m\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">2<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t).<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-177164\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-177164\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;7.&#160;&#160;&#160;Width of snow drift(s), <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">w<\/span>.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>",
